        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "(collectively, “Blackstone”) pursuant to which we have received funding for expenses related to the development of specific Diabetes products up to certain caps for each project (each, a “Blackstone Agreement” and collectively, the “Blackstone Agreements”), and Blackstone Agreements under which we have continuing financial obligations were assigned to us pursuant to the Separation Agreement.",
