        "end_character": 78215
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-045915",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-045915-afdd9349792ffcf0",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-045915",
        "filing_date": "2026-06-29",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As between us and Blackstone, we will be the sole and exclusive owner of all intellectual property rights to products developed under the Blackstone Agreements for future commercialization.",
        "start_character": 79084,
        "end_character": 79273
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-045915",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-045915-afdd9349792ffcf0",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-045915",
        "filing_date": "2026-06-29",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Because we commercialize all parts of an integrated diabetes management system, we are uniquely positioned to generate greater revenue per customer compared to competitors that only offer components of such systems and positions us to grow and take share through commercial execution, particularly with our next generation of products.",
        "start_character": 97325,
        "end_character": 97660
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-045915",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-045915-afdd9349792ffcf0",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-045915",
        "filing_date": "2026-06-29",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Blackstone may terminate a Blackstone Agreement: (i) if we fail to make certain capital investments and are unable to manufacture sufficient quantities of the product, (ii) if we are enjoined from continuing product development or commercialization, (iii) if we acquire rights to a competing product to the applicable product in certain specified markets, or (iv) if certain specified fundamental changes to the Company, or to our rights to the product, occur.",
        "start_character": 81517,
        "end_character": 81977
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-045915",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-045915-afdd9349792ffcf0",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-045915",
        "filing_date": "2026-06-29",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Consequently, we may not successfully obtain or maintain adequate patent protection for our products, manufacturing processes, delivery devices, sensors, software, designs, or packaging.",
        "start_character": 139887,
        "end_character": 140073
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-045915",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-045915-afdd9349792ffcf0",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-045915",
        "filing_date": "2026-06-29",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition to our team of professionals, we offer technology services for HCPs through our CareLink Clinic platform that helps them run their clinics more effectively.",
        "start_character": 110916,
        "end_character": 111084
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-045915",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-045915-afdd9349792ffcf0",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-045915",
        "filing_date": "2026-06-29",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In contrast, France delegates procurement, fulfillment, and training to private service providers, with whom we negotiate pricing and supply agreements.",
        "start_character": 119439,
        "end_character": 119591
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-045915",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-045915-afdd9349792ffcf0",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-045915",
        "filing_date": "2026-06-29",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In order to sell products through the pharmacy channel, we are also subject to certain state pharmacy licensing regulations.",
        "start_character": 166393,
        "end_character": 166517
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-045915",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-045915-afdd9349792ffcf0",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-045915",
        "filing_date": "2026-06-29",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In particular, we have made conscious design choices for the MiniMed Flex, our next-generation insulin pump, and the MiniMed Fit patch pump by leveraging our existing intellectual property portfolio to maintain optimal performance while enabling scalable manufacturing capabilities and minimizing execution risk.",
        "start_character": 128211,
        "end_character": 128523
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-045915",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-045915-afdd9349792ffcf0",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-045915",
        "filing_date": "2026-06-29",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In some EU/EEA Member States, such as Italy, we are not allowed to sell our products directly to patients.",
